promptState.template:
지금: {date}({weekday}) {clock} · {season} · {weather} · 여정 {year_no}년차 · {placed ? location : '자리는 도입부가 놓은 그곳'}
{settled ? '공방 「' + atelier_name + '」 — ' + atelier_place + ' · 스승 ' + mentor : '공방: 아직 없다 — 자리 잡는 장면부터가 이야기다'}
{settled ? '설비: 가마 ' + cauldron + '단 · 서고 ' + library + '단 · 보관고 ' + mat_n + '/' + mat_cap + ' · 약초밭 ' + garden + '단 · 다음 세금 ' + tax_due + '콜' : ''}
평판 {renown}({alch_tier}) · 소지금 {cole} · 체력 {stamina} · 투척 {bombs} · 직전 조합 {last_quality}
소재: {materials}
아이템: {items} · 레시피: {recipes}
진열대({shelf_n}/{shelf_cap}): {shelf}
밭({field_n}/{field_cap}): {field}
여기 가게: {shops_here} · 시세 {market_state}
의뢰({quest_slot} 남음): {quests}
도구: {tools} · 동행: {allies} · 단서 {clues} · 아는 채집지: {areas}
숙련: 폭탄 {sk_bomb} · 약품 {sk_med} · 중간재 {sk_mat} · 도구 {sk_tool} · 음식 {sk_food} · 비전 {sk_arcane}

statusUI.customCSS:
.sim-status { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 2px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(150,100,60,.14);
  font-family: 'Nunito', 'Quicksand', 'Noto Sans KR', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', system-ui, sans-serif; padding: 12px 14px; }
.sim-status summary { color: #ff9d7a; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .02em; opacity: 1; }
.sim-group { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 8px 11px; margin-top: 8px; }
.sim-group-label { color: #f3b94f; font-weight: 800; opacity: 1; font-size: .86em; letter-spacing: .04em; }
.sim-label { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-value { color: #5a4636; font-weight: 600; }
.sim-bar { height: 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff3df; border: 1px solid #f6e8d3; }
.sim-bar-fill { border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9d7a, #f3b94f); }
.sim-badge { background: #fff0c8; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 999px; }
.sim-tag { background: #fff3df; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 9px; }
.sim-empty { color: #c4b09b; opacity: 1; }
.sim-tabbar label, .sim-tabbar > * { border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; background: #fffdf7; color: #9a836f; }
.sim-tabbar label:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.sim-cards { gap: 6px; }
.sim-card { background: #fff8ec; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-left: 5px solid #8cc4ea; border-radius: 12px; }
.sim-card.good { border-left-color: #7fcfae; background: #dff5ea; }
.sim-card.bad { border-left-color: #f28ca6; background: #fdeaf0; }
.sim-card .d-up { color: #3aa374; } .sim-card .d-down { color: #d9536f; }
.sim-card-now, .sim-card-more { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-scn { background: #eee3fb; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #c6a6ec; border-radius: 999px; }
.sim-scn-prog { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-choices { background: #fff0c8; border: 1px solid #f3b94f; border-radius: 12px; color: #5a4636; }
.sim-choices-title, .sim-choices-desc, .sim-choices-hint { color: #5a4636; opacity: 1; }
.sim-choices-hint { color: #9a836f; }
.sim-action { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 1.5px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #f0dcc0; }
.sim-action:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.sim-action.sim-armed { background: #ffe3d6; border-color: #ff9d7a; color: #b34d2e; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #ff9d7a; }
.sim-action.sim-disabled { opacity: .45; box-shadow: none; }
.sim-action-state { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-action-hint, .sim-actlocked summary { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-log { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-log-name { color: #5a4636; }
.sim-log-diff.plus { color: #3aa374; } .sim-log-diff.minus { color: #d9536f; }
.sim-log-open .sim-log-item { border-bottom-color: #f6e8d3; }
.sim-cmds { border-top: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; }
.sim-cmds-open, .sim-cmds-hint, .sim-cmd-name, .sim-cmd-why { color: #9a836f; opacity: 1; }
.sim-cmd-syntax { background: #fff3df; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; border-radius: 8px; }

calendar.css:
#sc-game { background: rgba(120, 70, 40, .38); font-family: 'Nunito', 'Quicksand', 'Noto Sans KR', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #5a4636; }
.scg-card { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 2px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(150,100,60,.14); }
.scg-title { color: #ff9d7a; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .02em; }
.scg-title .scg-x { color: #9a836f; } .scg-title .scg-x:hover { background: #fff3df; color: #5a4636; }
.scg-note { color: #9a836f; }
.scg-notice { color: #b34d2e; background: #ffe3d6; border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; }
.scg-tpl .sim-tag { background: #fff3df; border-color: #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; }
.scg-tpl .sim-empty { color: #c4b09b; }
.scg-tabs { border-bottom: 2px solid #f0dcc0; }
.scg-tab { color: #9a836f; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0; }
.scg-tab:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.scg-tab.scg-on { background: #ff9d7a; border-color: #ff9d7a; color: #fff; }
.scg-nav-search, .scg-nav-sel { background: #fff8ec; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 12px; }
.scg-nav-search:focus { border-color: #ff9d7a; }
.scg-slot { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 14px; }
.scg-slot-row:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.scg-slot-label { color: #f3b94f; font-weight: 700; }
.scg-slot-val { color: #5a4636; } .scg-slot-val.scg-empty { color: #c4b09b; } .scg-slot-arrow { color: #c4b09b; }
.scg-chip { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 1.5px solid #f0dcc0; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #f0dcc0; }
.scg-chip:hover { background: #fff3df; border-color: #f3b94f; }
.scg-chip.scg-on { background: #ff9d7a; border-color: #ff9d7a; color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #d9744f; }
.scg-chip.scg-used { color: #9a836f; }
.scg-chip.scg-clear { background: #fdeaf0; border-color: #f28ca6; color: #b5405c; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #f28ca6; }
.scg-roster { color: #9a836f; }
.scg-points { color: #2f8f66; }
.scg-item { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 14px; }
.scg-item-name { color: #5a4636; } .scg-item-lv { color: #9a836f; } .scg-item-note { color: #9a836f; }
.scg-pips { color: #f3b94f; } .scg-pips .off { color: #f0dcc0; }
.scg-cost { color: #c98a1a; } .scg-maxed { color: #2f8f66; }
.scg-buy, .scb-btn, .scg-act, .scc-nav button, .scc-add button { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 1.5px solid #f0dcc0;
  border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #f0dcc0; }
.scg-buy:hover, .scb-btn:hover, .scg-act:hover, .scc-nav button:hover, .scc-add button:hover { background: #ffe3d6; border-color: #ff9d7a; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #ff9d7a; }
.scg-buy:disabled, .scb-btn:disabled { box-shadow: none; }
.scg-face { border-color: #f0dcc0; border-radius: 12px; }
/* 상점·의뢰판 */
.sch-wallet { color: #c98a1a; }
.sch-tab { background: #fffdf7; color: #9a836f; border: 1.5px solid #f0dcc0; }
.sch-tab:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.sch-tab.sch-on { background: #ff9d7a; border-color: #ff9d7a; color: #fff; }
.sch-item { border-bottom: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; }
.sch-item .sch-name { color: #5a4636; } .sch-item .sch-name small { color: #9a836f; }
.sch-grade { background: #eee3fb; border-color: #c6a6ec; color: #6f4fa8; border-radius: 999px; }
.sch-price { color: #c98a1a; } .sch-qty { color: #d9536f; }
.sch-log { border-top: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; color: #9a836f; }
.sch-exch-qty { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; border-radius: 12px; }
.scq-days { color: #3b86b8; } .scq-left { color: #9a836f; } .scq-cap { color: #2f8f66; }
/* 게시판 */
.scb-row { border-bottom: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; } .scb-row:hover { background: #fff3df; }
.scb-row .scb-num { color: #c4b09b; } .scb-row .scb-title { color: #5a4636; } .scb-row .scb-meta { color: #9a836f; }
.scb-view-title { color: #5a4636; } .scb-view-info { color: #9a836f; }
.scb-body { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; border-radius: 14px; }
.scb-re { border-top: 1px dashed #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; } .scb-re .scb-re-a { color: #3b86b8; }
.scb-del, .scb-re-x { color: #c4b09b; } .scb-re-x:hover { color: #d9536f; }
.scb-input, .scb-ta { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; border-radius: 12px; }
.scb-empty { color: #c4b09b; }
.scb-hot { background: #fff0c8; border: 1px solid #f3b94f; border-radius: 14px; }
.scb-hot-head { color: #b8761a; } .scb-hot-body { color: #5a4636; border-top: 1px dashed #f3b94f; } .scb-hot .scb-meta { color: #9a836f; }
/* 달력 */
.scc-nav .scc-month { color: #ff9d7a; }
.scc-wd { color: #f3b94f; font-weight: 700; }
.scc-day { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f6e8d3; border-radius: 10px; color: #5a4636; }
.scc-day:hover { background: #fff3df; border-color: #f0dcc0; }
.scc-day.scc-today { background: #ffe3d6; border-color: #ff9d7a; color: #b34d2e; }
.scc-day.scc-sel { border-color: #f3b94f; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #f3b94f inset; }
.scc-dot.scc-mark { background: #f3b94f; } .scc-dot.scc-plan { background: #8cc4ea; } .scc-dot.scc-due { background: #f28ca6; }
.scc-detail { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 14px; }
.scc-detail-date { color: #ff9d7a; } .scc-entry { color: #5a4636; } .scc-entry .scc-kind { color: #3b86b8; }
.scc-entry .scc-del { color: #9a836f; } .scc-entry .scc-del:hover { background: #fdeaf0; color: #d9536f; }
.scc-entry-note, .scc-legend { color: #9a836f; }
.scc-add input { background: #fffdf7; color: #5a4636; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 12px; }
.scc-add input:focus { border-color: #ff9d7a; }
/* 서신 */
.scm-bubble { background: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; border-radius: 16px 16px 16px 4px; }
.scm-mine .scm-bubble { background: #e0f0fb; border-color: #8cc4ea; border-radius: 16px 16px 4px 16px; }
.scm-from { color: #3b86b8; } .scm-body { color: #5a4636; } .scm-time { color: #c4b09b; } .scm-head { color: #5a4636; }
.scm-pick { border: 1px solid #f0dcc0; color: #5a4636; border-radius: 12px; }
.scm-pick.scm-on { background: #e0f0fb; border-color: #8cc4ea; color: #5a4636; }

